| k | Ordered vectors | A-threshold failures | B-threshold failures (excluding balanced) |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| 2 | 126 | 0 | 0 |
| 3 | 1,001 | 0 | 0 |
| 4 | 3,876 | 0 | 0 |
